ets/steam/apps/1787820/extras/35f890c852854dea172c6c7014ffa050.webm?t=1638606649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787820/extras/35f890c852854dea172c6c7014ffa050.mp4?t=1638606649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>We plan to increase the number of collectibles from 300 to 1000 before the formal release.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[FEATURE]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3D-Chibi rendition of characters from the Mirror Series.<br><br></li><li>Covered many genres of games of interesting mechanics.<br><br></li><li>Over 300 (1000 before the formal release) collectibles from the Gacha Machine.<br><br></li><li>On-line component, more people, more fun!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Come out and party with bishojos from the Mirror series in a world of fun mini-games featuring online mode. There\u2019s also a Gacha Machine where you can easily get OVER 300 pieces of collectibles (1000+ when upon formal release): CGs/Cosplay Album/Video/OST and more!",
